  "terminal": {
    "$description": "Terminal roles. The painter takes a role, never a colour code. Each role has a dark and a light value; ansi16 is the SGR for 16-colour terminals (basic ANSI has no orange, so ember is bright yellow); the 256-colour value is the nearest cube or grey entry, worked out by the generator.",
